<p>Best of all, our invoicing software is totally free for up to five clients, without any hidden catches, surprise credit card charges, or limitations on the number of invoices you can send. We even throw in four templates, custom branding, and online payments without charging a cent. You can also create payment reminders to notify clients when payments are due each month.</p>`,
